        dcterms:description "mean = 0.8926 ± 0.2774 across N = 17 bifurcations (within 0.39 SD of theoretical 1.00)" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "EDT medial-axis radius sampling across N = 17 degree-3 Y-junctions on physarum_polycephalum_specimen.jpg (SD = 0.2774)" ;
        schema:name "Physarum polycephalum specimen Y-junction Murray cubic radius ratio" ;
        schema:unitText "(r_1^3 + r_2^3) / r_0^3" ;
        schema:value "0.8926" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-physarum-polycephalum-specimen-y-junction-murray-cubic-radius-ratio-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-physarum-polycephalum-specimen-y-junction-murray-cubic-radius-ratio-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        schema:value "0.8926" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-shuttle-streaming-flow-reversals-per-actomyosin-contraction-cycle-active-tubes-gamma-1-8-network> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Shuttle-streaming flow reversals per actomyosin contraction cycle (active tubes, gamma = 1.8 network) = 1.7021 sign changes of Q_e(t) per cycle" ;
        dcterms:description "implied reversal period = 117.5 s for the imposed T_c = 100 s (T_c is an input, so only the 2-per-cycle locking is a model result); volume-closure residual = 1.3e-15, Kirchhoff error = 2.3e-14; Lean 4 Theorem 4" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Peristaltic Kirchhoff cycle (48 phase samples, eps = 0.0025, lambda = L_organism, T_c = 100 s) on the gamma=1.8 rest conductivities with the hub -> far-station source-sink pair; eps = 0 steady ablation gives 0.00 reversals" ;
        schema:name "Shuttle-streaming flow reversals per actomyosin contraction cycle (active tubes, gamma = 1.8 network)" ;
        schema:unitText "sign changes of Q_e(t) per cycle" ;
        schema:value "1.7021" ;
        schema:valueReference <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-shuttle-streaming-flow-reversals-per-actomyosin-contraction-cycle-active-tubes-gamma-1-8-network-reference> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-shuttle-streaming-flow-reversals-per-actomyosin-contraction-cycle-active-tubes-gamma-1-8-network-reference> a schema:PropertyValue ;
        schema:value "2.0" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-tero-physarum-transport-network-measurement-tokyo-rail-pareto-regime-gamma-1-8-fault-tolerance-ft> a schema:PropertyValue,
            pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "Tokyo rail Pareto regime (gamma = 1.8) Fault Tolerance FT = 0.7447 disconnect-free fraction" ;
        dcterms:description "eps = 0 steady ablation FT = 0.7500; fault tolerance gain = +0.7447 over tree-like MST limit (FT = 0.00)" ;
        schema:measurementTechnique "Bridge enumeration on the pruned gamma=1.8 network: fraction of active tubes whose removal disconnects no connected food-source pair (Betti-1 = 8 loops; MST baseline FT = 0.00)" ;
